      "## Statement\n\nLet $a<b$, let $n\\ge2$ be an even integer, and let\n$p(x)=c_0+c_1x+c_2x^2+c_3x^3$ with real coefficients. Then\n\n$$\\int_a^b p(x)\\,dx=Q_S(p;a,b,n),$$\n\nwhere $Q_S$ is the composite Simpson value of\n[[alg-composite-simpson-rule]]."
